[stderr] +| `ASSET-FBK-004` / P0 | Completion/result celebration shape. | complete/replay/static/reduced-motion/high-contrast. | Results remain understandable without it; it cannot cover actions. |
[stderr] +| `ASSET-SYS-001` / P0 | Offline, update, cached-package, and error symbols. | ready/offline/downloading/failed/recovery. | Icon, text, and pattern pair; semantic UI announces errors. |
