esentation and input. | J0 configure; J1. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:15:| Editorial contributor/reviewer | Produce original, factual, consistently adjudicated cards that are safe to release or correct. | J4 author-to-publish. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:16:| Release/support operator | Stage a content update or explain recovery without losing confirmed player state. | J5 update/recovery. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-17-\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:18:**Complete first-release journey (J1):** launch \u2192 optionally configure \u2192 enter\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-19-the five-card `First Whistle` tutorial \u2192 answer/receive text-plus-audio/visual\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-20-feedback \u2192 pause at a safe boundary if needed \u2192 finish results \u2192 create a\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-21-confirmed local milestone/snapshot \u2192 exit and resume. It works with packaged\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:22:content offline and no account, multiplayer, purchase, live event, or deferred\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-23-dependency.\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-24-\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-25-## Core journeys and edge paths\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-26-\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-27-| ID | Normal flow | Empty / invalid / denied / offline / conflict / recovery / deletion behaviour |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-28-| --- | --- | --- |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:29:| J0 Settings and consent | Open settings before/during a round; changes apply immediately or next safe boundary and persist locally. | Invalid value restores last valid value with explanation. Optional diagnostic/notification denial leaves all play enabled. Reset settings confirms scope. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:30:| J1 First Whistle | New local profile \u2192 tutorial \u2192 submit each answer \u2192 adjudication/explanation \u2192 results/snapshot. | Blank typed input cannot submit until explicitly confirm blank; malformed typed input resolves via normalisation then gives correction. No network is needed. Failure before a confirmed boundary offers retry/return home. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:31:| J2 Standard round/replay | Choose available theme \u2192 deterministic 10-card selection \u2192 resolve \u2192 results \u2192 replay/choose/exit. | Empty eligible pool shows unavailable category and a different eligible choice; repeat shortage is disclosed. Invalid/stale content is ineligible. No ranked or remote conflict exists. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:32:| J3 Pause, resume, recovery, deletion | Pause or interrupt \u2192 save confirmed snapshot \u2192 reopen \u2192 resume before next unresolved card. | Write failure preserves previous confirmed snapshot and offers retry/continue unsaved. Corrupt draft offers last confirmed snapshot/discard. Delete profile explicitly confirms and removes local history/snapshots/settings then returns to first launch. Remote conflict is not applicable: sync is excluded. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:33:| J4 Editorial publish/correct | Propose \u2192 provenance \u2192 fact check \u2192 accessibility/copy edit \u2192 second review \u2192 versioned publish \u2192 validate \u2192 stage/release or rollback. | Missing provenance, ambiguous answer, failed validation, or reviewer rejection blocks publish. Rights/source uncertainty is escalated, not guessed. Offline authoring cannot publish. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:34:| J5 Update/error support | Download/stage approved batch \u2192 apply between rounds \u2192 retain confirmed save \u2192 record minimum diagnostic only with consent. | Offline stays on cached compatible batch. Incompatible cache explains reset after save protection. Permission-denied diagnostics are skipped. Failed update rolls back/stays current; no mid-round replacement. |\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-35-\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-36-## Domain relationship map and invariants\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-37-\n--\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-42-                                               \u2502             \u2502                         \u2502\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-43-Platform/cache \u2500provides\u2192 input/rendering \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518             \u2514\u2500\u2192 Save snapshot \u2500\u2192 Recovery/delete\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-44-     \u2502                                                                        \u2502\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:45:Accessibility/settings \u2500applies to all player-facing nodes \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:46:Release/diagnostics \u2500stages/observes versions and errors; never changes a live round\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:47:Decision-gated identity/sync/safety/commerce have no first-release runtime edge.\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-48-```\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-49-\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-50-Cross-domain invariants: a resolved attempt references immutable card/version\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-51-and rule version; only published/reviewed cards may enter a round; score is a\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-52-deterministic projection of attempts; confirmed snapshots are append/replace\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-53-only after validation; content updates occur between rounds; local deletion\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:54:removes all local profile-linked records; accessibility settings affect every\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-55-path; diagnostics contain no answer text, typed answer, or unnecessary identity\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-56-data. Lifecycle boundaries are content publish/rollback, round start/resolution/\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-57-complete/abandon, snapshot confirmation/recovery/deletion, and cache stage/apply.\n--\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-66-and `ResultSummary` (computed \u2192 viewed \u2192 archived). **Rules:** one unresolved\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-67-card at a time; a submission is immutable after resolution; results are\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-68-idempotent; replay creates a new run. **Inputs/dependencies:** content version,\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:69:selection seed, settings, persistence, input/rendering. **Outcome:** an\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md-70-understandable quick session. **Edge cases:** back during draft asks whether to\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-feature-model.md:71:discard; unavailable theme has an explanatory empty state;